  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "act_iron_large_saw",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_IronLargeSaw_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Crafted:</b> From 2 iron sheets, 4 metal nails and 2 wood using a hammer.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Cuts large trees faster than the copper saw while sharp: a large pine or willow falls in one pull and a large birch or oak in two. Each pull adds 1 Dullness; at 25 it is blunt and cuts like an axe until you drag a stone or whetstone onto it. Can be recycled in a furnace."
  },
